  "body": "Offering 3 bedrooms, with the potential to easily create a 4-bedroom plus 2 generous living areas, there's room for everyone to spread out. Perfect for families with older children, extended family or those seeking a semi-independent living arrangement, this is an opportunity to secure a home that can grow and adapt with you. \r\n\r\nModernised and move-in ready, this is a home that offers so much more than meets the eye.\r\nPositioned in the sought-after coastal suburb of Rothesay Bay, 1/21 Montgomery Avenue presents an exciting opportunity for families looking for space, flexibility and a home that's ready to enjoy.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Modernised throughout and move-in ready.\r\n* Brick exterior for timeless appeal.\r\n* 3 double bedrooms, plus potential for a fourth.\r\n* 2 separate living areas.\r\n* 2 bathrooms (one with a bath), with room to add a 3rd.\r\n* Flexible layout ideal for families or multi-generational living.\r\n* Potential to create a self-contained space for extended family, teenagers or guests.\r\n* Conveniently located close to local beaches, shops, cafes and everyday amenities.\r\n* Zoned for Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College.\r\n* Generous off-street parking with ample room for a boat, motorhome or additional vehicles.\r\n\r\nModern & move-in ready, this is an opportunity not to be missed in a popular North Shore location.",
